{"id":30291055800640,"type":"artist","name":"Vic Chesnutt","artist":null,"year":1964,"weight":11,"info":{"tags":["singer-songwriter","folk","Alt-country","indie","americana"],"country":"US","begin":"1964-11-12","end":"2009-12-25","kind":"Person","similar":["Smog","Jason Molina","Palace Music","Songs: Ohia","Magnolia Electric Co.","Bill Callahan","Bonnie 'Prince' Billy","Howe Gelb","Lambchop","Sparklehorse"],"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/b5913420c260b43ec593df1fa7861c5a/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"James Victor Chesnutt, más conocido como Vic Chesnutt fue un cantante nacido en Jacksonville, Florida el 12 de noviembre de 1964, y se suicida el 25 de diciembre de 2009.\n\nSufrió algunas lesiones por un accidente de coche a los 18 años que lo dejaron parcialmente paralizado y tenía un uso limitado de las manos, utilizó una silla de ruedas desde entonces. Se le considera uno de los exponentes más importantes del sonido contemporáneo estadounidense."},"works":[{"id":43989083545550,"type":"album","name":"West Of Rome","artist":"Vic Chesnutt","year":1992,"weight":17,"yt":"6wzefMoPGYs","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":1310,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":103254340346721,"name":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Americana","rank":119,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":118798969175346,"name":"RYM Top — Country — Alt-Country","rank":130,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":232615275710380,"type":"album","name":"Drunk","artist":"Vic Chesnutt","year":1994,"weight":6,"yt":"o7vAo2nEyzc","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":211404124660991,"type":"album","name":"Is The Actor Happy","artist":"Vic Chesnutt","year":1995,"weight":11,"yt":"nJyrc4P1IC8","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts"